  "_legend": "Kin Clinic and Provisioner face each other across the drovers lane, one set a row lower than the other so the street is not a mirror. The Concord survey office and a house sit on the back lane south. The east road is closed by fallen stone.",
  "_plan": "Four roads meet here and the sign says so: Route 3 west, Route 4 south, the drovers lane north to the holding pens, and the east road, shut by a rockfall since before anyone here was born. They meet on the paved yard, which is why the town exists -- a halt where stock is watered at the trough before the last push to the coast. Every lane ends at a door, a gate or a junction; the only ones that reach the map edge are the two that are actually exits."
